{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>ויסך</b> — four times in the Masorah: <b>ויסך</b> (here), <b>ויסך אלוה בעדו</b>, <b>ויסך בדלתים</b>, <b>וירחץ ויסך</b> by David. In the merit of <b>ויסך בדלתים</b> — that as long as he was an onen he did not enter the Temple until <b>וירחץ ויסך</b> — he merited <b>ויסך</b> on the ark: <b>ויסך אלוה בעדו</b>."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:19.313692777Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}